ng by itself but it triggers several Post Actions that are responsible for the maintenance of an Inspection Order, such as cleaning or deleting the entities related to the given Inspection Order. It triggers the following Post Actions:\r\n-TagForMaintenanceQualityInspections\r\n-TagForMaintenanceInspectionOrderSample\r\n-TagForMaintenanceInspectionWorkProcessesToBeDeleted\r\n-TagForMaintenanceInspectionTasks\r\n-TagForMaintenanceInspectionProductionHistoryRecords\r\n-TagForMaintenanceInspectionEquipmentOperationsTracking\r\n-TagForMaintenanceInspectionStepFlows\r\n-TagForMaintenanceInspectionWorkInstructions","FullInfo":"This command starts the maintenance process of an Inspection Order. \r\nIt does not perform anything by itself but it triggers several Post Actions that are responsible for the maintenance of an Inspection Order, such as cleaning or deleting the entities related to the given Inspection Order. It triggers the following Post Actions:\r\n-TagForMaintenanceQualityInspections\r\n-TagForMaintenanceInspectionOrderSample\r\n-TagForMaintenanceInspectionWorkProcessesToBeDeleted\r\n-TagForMaintenanceInspectionTasks\r\n-TagForMaintenanceInspectionProductionHistoryRecords\r\n-TagForMaintenanceInspectionEquipmentOperationsTracking\r\n-TagForMaintenanceInspectionStepFlows\r\n-TagForMaintenanceInspectionWorkInstructions","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"149"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"This command starts the maintenance process of an Inspection Order. \r\nIt does not perform anything by itself but it triggers several Post Actions that are responsible for the maintenance of an Inspection Order, such as cleaning or deleting the entities related to the given Inspection Order. It triggers the following Post Actions:\r\n-TagForMaintenanceQualityInspections\r\n-TagForMaintenanceInspectionOrderSample\r\n-TagForMaintenanceInspectionWorkProcessesToBeDeleted\r\n-TagForMaintenanceIns